      <sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>14.0</sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>
      <description><![CDATA[<ul>
<li>Auto-sync keeps running after you sign in. Since 2.0 it could sync once after a sign-in and then wait for you to press Sync.</li>
<li>No more sign-in screen after a restart when you are still signed in. OhNine now waits for macOS to load your login before deciding.</li>
</ul>]]></description>
