    <item>
      <title>2.1.0</title>
      <pubDate>Wed, 30 Sep 2026 23:05:06 GMT</pubDate>
      <sparkle:version>210</sparkle:version>
      <sparkle:shortVersionString>2.1.0</sparkle:shortVersionString>
      <sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>14.0</sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>
      <description><![CDATA[<ul>
<li>Claw'd has moods now. At 91% he gets scared and sweaty. When your weekly limit runs out, it's RIP: flat on his back with crows and a tombstone. When a model limit like Fable runs out, he hobbles on a crutch until it resets.</li>
<li>After a sync he sometimes shows off. Jump rope, juggling, a kickflip, a jetpack and six more.</li>
<li>New font choice: Comic Sans MS, for the culture. Outfit stays the default. OpenDyslexic is gone.</li>
<li>The System font no longer squeezes "manual" onto two lines.</li>
</ul>]]></description>
      <enclosure url="https://github.com/raxxostudios/ohnine-releases/releases/download/v2.1.0/OhNine-2.1.0.dmg" sparkle:edSignature="6eK/rd0OA6t+iC6E4ZnepyKec4BbjaqIwb400yEekGAKyU2iHo4M9wMGy/YBZv7Y/2PE0erEoaCZUA05owLUBg==" length="7570758" type="application/octet-stream"/>
    </item>
