      <sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>14.0</sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>
      <description><![CDATA[<h2>OhNine 2.0: rebuilt as a native Mac app</h2>
<ul>
<li>About 5 MB, one download for Apple silicon and Intel</li>
<li>Signed and notarized by Apple, updates itself from now on</li>
<li>Syncs through claude.ai's own API in well under a second</li>
<li>No more random "sign in" prompts</li>
<li>Several Claude accounts, a workspace picker and usage credits</li>
<li>A notification the moment your session resets</li>
<li>Liquid Glass and a 3D Claw'd who trudges home at the limit</li>
</ul>
<p>Sign in once more after updating.</p>]]></description>
